   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Method and policy support</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Metod- och policyst&#xf6;d</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">According to the operational plan for the team for Gender Equality methods for gender mainstreaming will be elaborated and for this purpose, external expertise has been contracted as support. The assignement can inlcude thematic studies about GBV and WEE, analyzes of international processes, method support in thematic areas and production of indicators, fact sheets etc.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Enligt j&#xe4;mst&#xe4;lldhetsteamets verksamhetsplan ska metoder f&#xf6;r  mainstreaming av j&#xe4;mst&#xe4;lldhet tas fram och extern expertis har upphandlats f&#xf6;r st&#xf6;d i detta arbete. Uppdraget kan omfatta &#xe4;mnesstudier, f&#xf6;rdjupningar inom GBV och WEE, analyser av internationella processer, metodst&#xf6;d inom sakomr&#xe5;den och f&#xf6;r framtagande av indikatorer, fact sheets etc.</narrative>
  </description>
